# translations for aliases
#: puavo-laptop-setup:25
msgid "latest"
msgstr "senaste"

#: puavo-laptop-setup:25
msgid "stable"
msgstr "stabil"

#: puavo-laptop-setup:25
msgid "penultimate"
msgstr "näst senaste"

#: puavo-laptop-setup:25
msgid "test"
msgstr "test"

#: puavo-laptop-setup:230
msgid "and"
msgstr "och"

#: puavo-laptop-setup:312
msgid ""
"It is now possible to choose Windows from the boot menu when starting up the "
"computer."
msgstr ""
"Windows har nu tilläggats till startmenun. Menun syns alltid när man startar "
"om datorn."

#: puavo-laptop-setup:316
msgid ""
"Abitti 2 is not updated when running Windows, you have to boot into the "
"current system to update it."
msgstr ""
"Obs! Abitti 2 uppdateras inte när datorn har startats till Windows. För att "
"byta / uppdatera din laptops Abitti 2 måste man välja normal start och välja "
"det här Opinsys Os som används nu."

#: puavo-laptop-setup:463
msgid "error saving changes"
msgstr "fel i sparning av ändringarna "

#: puavo-laptop-setup:498
msgid "Factory reset is running step"
msgstr "Fabriksåterställning kör steg"

#: puavo-laptop-setup:511
msgid "Factory reset is running"
msgstr "Fabriksåterställning pågår"

#: puavo-laptop-setup:519
msgid "Failed to start factory reset"
msgstr "Fabriksåterställningen kunde inte börjas"

#: puavo-laptop-setup:522 puavo-laptop-setup:553
msgid "Factory reset failed"
msgstr "Fabriksåterställningen mislyckades"

#: puavo-laptop-setup:540
msgid "Factory reset succeeded."
msgstr "Fabriksåterställningen lyckades."

#: puavo-laptop-setup:542
msgid "The system is going to reboot in few seconds..."
msgstr "Systemet startar om i några sekunder..."

#: puavo-laptop-setup:555
msgid ""
"Further details can be found from the factory reset log. Please contact "
"support for assistance."
msgstr ""
"Ytterligare detaljer kan hittas från fabriksåterställningsloggen. Kontakta "
"supporten för hjälp."

#: puavo-laptop-setup:647 puavo-laptop-setup:693
msgid "Laptop setup"
msgstr "Laptop inställningar"

#: puavo-laptop-setup:683
msgid "You do not have the required permissions to use this tool."
msgstr "Du har inte tillräckliga rättigheter att använda verktyget."

#: puavo-laptop-setup:693
msgid "is already running"
msgstr "är redan igång"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:20 puavo-laptop-setup.glade:31
msgid "Abitti 2 version"
msgstr "Abitti 2-version"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:42
msgid "Show developer mode in boot menu"
msgstr "Visa utvecklarläge i startmenyn"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:53
msgid "Default operating system at boot"
msgstr "Standardoperativsystem i starten"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:67
msgid "school versions"
msgstr "skolversioner"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:94
msgid "flexible version"
msgstr "flexibel version"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:119
msgid "this version"
msgstr "den här versionen"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:164 puavo-laptop-setup.glade:344
msgid "Puavo OS (Linux)"
msgstr "Puavo OS (Linux)"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:180
msgid "Abitti 2"
msgstr "Abitti 2"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:196 puavo-laptop-setup.glade:360
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

# from puavo-laptop-setup.glade
#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:232
msgid "Start using Windows"
msgstr "Aktivera Windows"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:251
msgid "Factory reset..."
msgstr "Fabriksåterställning..."

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:277
msgid "Confirmation of factory reset"
msgstr "Bekräftelse på fabriksåterställning"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:295
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Avbryt"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:311
msgid "Reset"
msgstr "Återställa"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:334
msgid "Select operating systems to reset:"
msgstr "Välj operativsystem som ska återställas:"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:380
msgid ""
"<big>Factory reset <span foreground=\"red\" size=\"x-large\">erases all user "
"data</span> from selected operating systems and restores their state to "
"factory settings!</big>"
msgstr ""
"<big>Fabriksåterställning <span foreground=\"red\" size=\"x-large\"> raderar "
"all användardata</span> från valda operativsystem och återställer deras "
"tillstånd till fabriksinställningarna!</big>"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:395
msgid "Factory reset"
msgstr "Fabriksåterställning"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:410
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Stäng"

#: puavo-laptop-setup.glade:455
msgid "Factory reset log"
msgstr "Fabriksåterställningslogg"
